    "directions": [
      "In a tray or a bowl, add garlic, onion, cinnamon stick, black cardamom, green cardamom and cloves.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it coarsely.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add prepared paste, coriander powder, degi red chili powder, fennel seeds powder, dry ginger powder, salt to taste, mustard oil and give a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to an airtight container for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add chicken legs, degi red chili powder, salt to taste, caraway seeds, curd, mustard oil and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for a while.",
      "In a handi, add butter, once it's melted, add prepared masala, mustard oil and saute it for a minute until aromatic.",
      "Add marinated chicken and saute it well for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add tender coriander stems, curd, butter and mix it well.",
      "Cover it with a lid and cook it for 10-12 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti."
    ],
